        sh:in           ( cim:MeasurementValueSource cim:RegulationSchedule cim:EnergySource cim:AsynchronousMachine cim:GeographicalRegion cim:DCDisconnector cim:RegulatingControl cim:Breaker cim:Analog cim:WindGeneratingUnit cim:GrossToNetActivePowerCurve cim:NuclearGeneratingUnit cim:ControlAreaGeneratingUnit cim:Line cim:StringMeasurementValue cim:EnergyConsumer cim:SetPoint cim:PhaseTapChangerAsymmetrical cim:ApparentPowerLimit cim:LinearShuntCompensator cim:ControlArea cim:RatioTapChangerTablePoint cim:BaseVoltage cim:SubGeographicalRegion cim:PowerTransformer cim:Terminal cim:SeriesCompensator cim:VoltageLevel cim:AnalogLimitSet cim:SubLoadArea cim:RatioTapChangerTable cim:ExternalNetworkInjection cim:PerLengthDCLineParameter cim:EquivalentBranch cim:AnalogLimit cim:TapChangerTablePoint cim:ConformLoadGroup cim:GeneratingUnit cim:GroundDisconnector cim:NonConformLoadSchedule cim:DCBusbar cim:PhaseTapChangerSymmetrical cim:Disconnector cim:BusNameMarker cim:NonlinearShuntCompensator cim:Substation cim:ConnectivityNode cim:TieFlow cim:ThermalGeneratingUnit cim:DayType cim:DCGround cim:DCEquipmentContainer cim:Season cim:DCConverterUnit cim:LoadBreakSwitch cim:LoadArea cim:DCLineSegment cim:Switch cim:FossilFuel cim:PowerTransformerEnd cim:TapChangerControl cim:LoadResponseCharacteristic cim:Accumulator cim:DCTerminal cim:ValueToAlias cim:StationSupply cim:DiscreteValue cim:MeasurementValueQuality cim:RatioTapChanger cim:ACLineSegment cim:DCSeriesDevice cim:DCShunt cim:Command cim:ConformLoad cim:StaticVarCompensator cim:DCLine cim:HydroPowerPlant cim:BusbarSection cim:SolarGeneratingUnit cim:ActivePowerLimit cim:DCNode cim:SwitchSchedule cim:AnalogValue cim:PhaseTapChangerLinear entsoe:EnergySchedulingType cim:VsCapabilityCurve cim:EquivalentNetwork cim:ConformLoadSchedule cim:CsConverter cim:HydroGeneratingUnit cim:DCBreaker cim:DCSwitch cim:NonlinearShuntCompensatorPoint cim:PhaseTapChangerTable cim:TapSchedule cim:AccumulatorReset cim:SynchronousMachine cim: